 This project is a sample news application built with Astro, designed to serve as a testing ground for new features in Chrome DevTools.
 
+## AI agent tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up forms expose `sign_in` and `sign_up` using the
+[WebMCP declarative API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api).
+In a browser with WebMCP enabled, each tool is available on its corresponding
+page after the React form hydrates. Both accept required `username` and `password`
+parameters and submit automatically using the same client-side handler as the UI.
+Results contain `{ success, message }`; credentials and authentication tokens are
+not included in tool results. Browsers without WebMCP retain normal form behavior.
+
 
 ```sh
 pnpm install && pnpm run start
